# TwinleafTown — Platinum-style starter town (Emerald Petalburg houses).
# Legend: T tree  . grass  f flower  b bush  = dirt path  ~ water  F fence
#          S sign  (no tall-grass encounters in town)
# Stamps: P player  V rival  A house1  B house2 (door anchors)
@name TwinleafTown
@layout LAYOUT_TWINLEAF_TOWN
@width 32
@height 32
@primary gTileset_General
@secondary gTileset_Petalburg
@connection up MAP_ROUTE201 0
@stamp P PLAYER_HOUSE MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_PLAYERSHOUSE_1F 0
@stamp V RIVAL_HOUSE MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_RIVALSHOUSE_1F 0
@stamp A HOUSE_A MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_HOUSE1 0
@stamp B HOUSE_A MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_HOUSE2 0
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_RivalsHouseSign
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_TownSign
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_PlayersHouseSign
@grid
